     "message": "SSRIs/SNRIs + MAO inhibitors: serotonin syndrome.",
     "source": "Phansalkar 2012, Table 2, DDI #8"},

    {"id": "PH11-IRINOTECAN-CYP3A4I", "category": "ddi", "action": "contraindicated",
