     "message": "Irinotecan + strong CYP3A4 inhibitors: irinotecan toxicity.",
     "source": "Phansalkar 2012, Table 2, DDI #11"},

    {"id": "PH16-OPIOID-MAOI", "category": "ddi", "action": "contraindicated",
