     "message": "Narcotic analgesics + MAO inhibitors: serotonin syndrome / severe reactions.",
     "source": "Phansalkar 2012, Table 2, DDI #16"},

    {"id": "PH20-TCA-MAOI", "category": "ddi", "action": "contraindicated",
     "members_a": [{"atc":"tca"}],
